{% About title="About us" subtitle="KreativeTab is a Derby-based studio. We do four things: brand kits, websites, web apps and mobile apps." content="<br/><br/><span class=\"text-neutral-400\">We help local businesses and founders look professional and get online fast. Brand kits give you a logo, colours and fonts you can use everywhere. Websites are built in Astro for speed and SEO, with copywriting, Google Business Profile set-up and an easy CMS included. Web apps are built in Next.js and React, and mobile apps in React Native for iPhone and Android. Every package has a fixed price on the page, and you own your code. Based in Derby, happy to meet locally.</span>" /%}

